# Agent Behavior

## Communication
- No apologies; no "I understand"
- Do not repeat a confirmation the user already gave this session. That limit does not cancel the one question required when a request has no outcome or no boundary
- Direct answers; don't summarize changes unless asked
- Links to real files only

## Change hygiene
- Only change what was requested; preserve unrelated code
- No whitespace-only drive-bys
- Don't show current implementation unless asked
